      102  Makasol
      103  [ edit ]
      104  The Makasol (or "Wind Nation"), also known as Paliau movement, is neo-traditional Millenarianist counter-cultural religious and social movement in Papua New Guinea. Its base is in the Manus Province , a motherland of its founder, the prophet Paliau Maloat ( d.  1991 ). He had served in the colonial 
